---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const page = {
  title: "Refund and Returns Policy",
  h1: "Refund and Returns Policy",
  description: "Effective Date:",
  canonical: "/refund_returns/",
  author: "",
  date: "",
};
const hreflang = "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/zh/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh-tw\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/zh-tw/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/ar/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/fr/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/de/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"it\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/it/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/ja/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/ko/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"pt\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/pt/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/ru/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/es/refund_returns/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"th\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/th/refund_returns/\" />";
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="article">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Refund and Returns Policy for DinWeys Co., Ltd.</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Effective Date: [Insert Date]</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">At DinWeys Co., Ltd., we strive to ensure customer satisfaction with our products and services. This Refund and Returns Policy outlines the conditions under which returns, refunds, and exchanges are provided. By making a purchase on <a href="https://www.dinweys.com">https://www.dinweys.com</a>, you agree to the terms set out in this policy.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong>Returns Eligibility</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">To be eligible for a return, your item must meet the following criteria:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>The item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it.</li><li>The item must be in its original packaging.</li><li>You must provide proof of purchase, such as an order confirmation or receipt.</li><li>Return requests must be made within [insert timeframe, e.g., 30 days] from the date of delivery.</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Non-Returnable Items</strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Certain types of goods are exempt from being returned, including but not limited to:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Perishable goods (e.g., food, flowers)</li><li>Custom or personalized items</li><li>Downloadable software or digital products</li><li>Gift cards</li><li>Hazardous materials or flammable liquids</li></ul><h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. <strong>Return Process</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">To initiate a return, please follow these steps:</p><ol class="wp-block-list"><li>Contact our customer service team at <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a> to request a return authorization.</li><li>Once your return is approved, you will receive instructions on how and where to send the item.</li><li>Customers are responsible for paying return shipping costs unless the return is due to a defect or an error on our part.</li></ol><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Please do not send the item back without receiving authorization from our team, as it may result in delays in processing your return.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. <strong>Refunds</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Once we receive your returned item, we will inspect it and notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund. If approved, your refund will be processed within 14 days, and a credit will automatically be applied to your original method of payment.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Partial Refunds</strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">In some cases, only partial refunds may be granted, such as:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Items that are not in their original condition, damaged, or missing parts for reasons not due to our error.</li><li>Returns initiated after the 30-day return period has expired.</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Late or Missing Refunds</strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you haven’t received a refund after the stated processing period, please check your bank account or credit card statement again. Then, contact your credit card company or bank, as it may take some time before the refund is posted. If you still have not received your refund, please contact us at <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong>Exchanges</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We will replace items if they are defective or damaged. If you need to exchange a product for the same item, please contact us at [insert contact email or phone number] and follow the instructions provided by our customer service team. Exchange requests must be made within [insert timeframe, e.g., 30 days] of receiving the item.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. <strong>Shipping Costs for Returns</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Unless the return is due to a defect or our error, the customer is responsible for covering return shipping costs. We recommend using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance, as we cannot guarantee that we will receive your returned item.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. <strong>Cancellations</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You may cancel your order for a full refund if it has not yet been shipped. Once the order has been shipped, it will be subject to the return policy outlined above. Please contact our customer service team immediately to cancel an order.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. <strong>Damaged or Incorrect Items</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, please contact us within [insert timeframe, e.g., 7 days] of receiving the product. We will provide instructions for returning the item and arrange a replacement or refund at no additional cost to you.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. <strong>Contact Us</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you have any questions about our Refund and Returns Policy, please contact us at:</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>DinWeys Co., Ltd.</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>ADD: #3 building North Silicon Valley, Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou City, Hebei, China</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Email:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Phone: +86 13323237275</strong></p>`} />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
